    "detailed_description": "GET READY FOR A WILD RIDE!<br><br>Be brave young Player ! Push the door of the elemental dungeon and defeat your friends to survive!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A crazy race with your friends</h2>Torch is a platform game where you have to jump and change elements to fit the dungeon platforms! This game allows you to play up to 4 players locally. Win the game by being faster and smarter than your opponents!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A unique ascension</h2><br>Each new game, you will face a new tower to climb! Whether it be the type of platforms or their positions, nothing will ever be the same again...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">From heaven to hell</h2><br>The higher you climb in the dungeon, the more difficult it will become: the platforms will become less numerous, less large but also less immobile.... Only the most daring will triumph over hell...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Controllers</h2>You can play in :<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"> <li> solo mode with a controller or keyboard : get as high as you can<br> </li><li> local multiplayer mode with at least one controller + other controllers or keyboard : distance your opponent(s) to win the race !</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "GET READY FOR A WILD RIDE!<br><br>Be brave young Player ! Push the door of the elemental dungeon and defeat your friends to survive!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A crazy race with your friends</h2>Torch is a platform game where you have to jump and change elements to fit the dungeon platforms! This game allows you to play up to 4 players locally. Win the game by being faster and smarter than your opponents!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A unique ascension</h2><br>Each new game, you will face a new tower to climb! Whether it be the type of platforms or their positions, nothing will ever be the same again...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">From heaven to hell</h2><br>The higher you climb in the dungeon, the more difficult it will become: the platforms will become less numerous, less large but also less immobile.... Only the most daring will triumph over hell...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Controllers</h2>You can play in :<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"> <li> solo mode with a controller or keyboard : get as high as you can<br> </li><li> local multiplayer mode with at least one controller + other controllers or keyboard : distance your opponent(s) to win the race !</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Jump, transform and triumph over your opponents in an insane climb in Torch the elements platform game !",
